UPDATE tools SET faq = $x$[{"a": "Relevance AI é uma plataforma para criar agentes de IA e sistemas multiagente sem programação avançada. Os agentes podem usar ferramentas, pesquisar na web, ler documentos e chamar APIs para concluir tarefas complexas de várias etapas. É usada para automação de vendas, pesquisa, suporte ao cliente e enriquecimento de dados.", "q": "O que é Relevance AI?"}, {"a": "Não. O plano Free do Relevance AI foi descontinuado tanto para novos cadastros quanto para contas existentes. Segundo a documentação do fornecedor, o Pro começa em US$ 19/mês na cobrança anual (US$ 29/mês na cobrança mensal), e o Team começa em US$ 234/mês na cobrança anual (US$ 349/mês na cobrança mensal). O preço do Enterprise é personalizado e cotado via equipe de vendas.", "q": "Relevance AI é gratuito?"}, {"a": "Zapier automatiza fluxos de trabalho fixos baseados em regras entre aplicativos. Relevance AI cria agentes de IA que raciocinam e se adaptam — eles usam modelos de IA para decidir o que fazer a seguir. Zapier é automação determinística; Relevance é tomada de decisão autônoma por IA.", "q": "Qual é a diferença entre Relevance AI e Zapier?"}, {"a": "O Copilot Studio pode criar agentes que executam ações, mas é projetado principalmente para chatbots conversacionais dentro do ecossistema da Microsoft. Relevance AI é mais especializado em agentes autônomos complexos de várias etapas que podem usar diversas ferramentas externas.", "q": "O Copilot Studio consegue criar agentes autônomos?"}]$x$::jsonb
 WHERE slug = 'relevance-ai' AND lang = 'pt';

UPDATE tools SET best_for = $x$AI content generation and GTM workflow automation for marketing teams$x$
 WHERE slug = 'copy-ai' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description = $x$Copy.ai is a GTM AI Platform (chat plus multi-step workflows and agents for sales, marketing and RevOps) built on OpenAI, Anthropic and Google models. There is no free plan; the entry tier is Chat at $29/mo, with a custom-priced Enterprise tier above it.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'copy-ai' AND lang = 'en';

UPDATE tools SET description_long = $x$Copy.ai started life as an AI copywriting assistant and has since repositioned itself as a "GTM AI Platform" aimed at go-to-market teams rather than individual writers. Instead of a single proprietary model, it routes work across leading third-party models from OpenAI, Anthropic and Google.

In October 2025, Copy.ai was acquired by Fullcast. The copy.ai website itself still carries the Copy.ai brand ("The First AI-Native GTM Platform"); Fullcast shows up in the support email and a banner link rather than in the main branding. Copy.ai's acquisition page also references early-access workflows under the name "Fullcast Propel (powered by Copy.ai)", though it is unclear whether the whole product will eventually be renamed.

Core capabilities split in two: a chat interface for everyday drafting (ads, emails, posts, briefs) and multi-step Workflows and agents that automate repetitive go-to-market tasks such as lead enrichment, account research and outbound sequences. The workflow layer is where the platform's real value sits.

There is no free product tier. The current pricing page lists just two options: Self-Serve Chat at $29/mo billed monthly, with 5 seats and unlimited words, and a custom-priced Enterprise tier with guided implementation, API access, bulk workflow runs and 20+ integrations, available by demo. The previously published Growth, Expansion and Scale team tiers are no longer shown on the pricing page.

The main limitations are the pricing cliff between the $29 Chat plan and the custom Enterprise tier, with no published mid-range option, and the lack of transparent pricing for teams that need more than basic chat. Solo copywriters may also feel the tool has drifted away from them.

Copy.ai suits sales and marketing teams that want to automate go-to-market work with agents and workflows and are willing to go through a sales process for anything beyond the entry Chat plan. Individual writers who just want cheap copy generation have better-value options elsewhere.$x$
 WHERE slug = 'copy-ai' AND lang = 'en';

